        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.422,
            0.504,
            0.54,
            0.519
          ],
          "content": "D. 酶偶联受体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.528,
            0.749,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": "20. 植物细胞壁中的纤维素和果胶质是在下述哪一细胞器中合成的？（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.552,
            0.307,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "A. 高尔基体"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.357,
            0.552,
            0.476,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "B. 光面内质网"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.518,
            0.552,
            0.638,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "C. 粗面内质网"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.679,
            0.552,
            0.784,
            0.567
          ],
          "content": "D. 中央液泡"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.576,
            0.859,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": "21. 可通过简单扩散方式穿越质膜脂质双分子层, 从一个细胞输送到另一个细胞的信息分子为: ( )"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.623,
            0.253,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": "A. NO"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.294,
            0.624,
            0.339,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": "B. IP₃"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.38,
            0.624,
            0.45,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": "C. cAMP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.498,
            0.623,
            0.555,
            0.638
          ],
          "content": "D.  $Ca^{2+}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.647,
            0.636,
            0.662
          ],
          "content": "22. 以下不能促使非洲爪蟾卵母细胞成熟的方法是:（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.671,
            0.303,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": "A. 浸于孕酮"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.458,
            0.671,
            0.649,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": "B. 注射促成熟因子 MPF"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.695,
            0.41,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": "C. 注射周期蛋白的 mRNA"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.459,
            0.695,
            0.549,
            0.71
          ],
          "content": "D. 针刺激。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.719,
            0.576,
            0.735
          ],
          "content": "23. 在一个细胞周期中，cdc 蛋白激酶的含量（）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.743,
            0.356,
            0.759
          ],
          "content": "A. 发生周期性变化"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.45,
            0.744,
            0.548,
            0.759
          ],
          "content": "B. 是恒定的"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.768,
            0.393,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": "C. 受周期蛋白 B 的调控"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.451,
            0.768,
            0.586,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": "D. 前几者都不是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.792,
            0.733,
            0.807
          ],
          "content": "24. 内质网中可以识别不正确折叠的蛋白并促使其重新折叠的是: ( )"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.816,
            0.291,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": "A. Bip 蛋白"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.334,
            0.817,
            0.438,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "B. Sec61 蛋白"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.481,
            0.817,
            0.596,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "C. 钙结合蛋白"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.642,
            0.817,
            0.813,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "D. 蛋白二硫键异构酶"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.84,
            0.485,
            0.856
          ],
          "content": "25. 微管装配提供能量的物质是: ( )"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.864,
            0.258,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "A. ATP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.342,
            0.864,
            0.398,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "B. CTP"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.474,
            0.864,
            0.532,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "C. GTP"
        },
        {
